    "t27c diagnostics pinned to the .t27 line in the diff, at most 50 per call",
    "vacuous tests and dead specs as alerts that persist across commits and close when fixed",
    "which .t27 files a PR touches, so only those specs are checked",
    "t27c fmt drift as one-click suggestion blocks; review event COMMENT, never APPROVE",
    "the specs and seals at the PR head, read without a clone",
    "regenerated gen/ and reseals as a bot commit; unlike GITHUB_TOKEN, an App push re-runs CI",
